title: metarecord-list:set
tags: [[GUI command]] Metarecord
kind: reference
summary: Metarecord list: change a view setting

Changes a setting of the [[metarecord-list panel]] in this workspace: `mode` (`table` or `grid`, [[Display modes]]), `page-size`, the number of rows loaded at a time, or `order`, the `int` field it is ordered by, none when empty ([[Ordering a list]]) — which writes the positions of what has none.
